&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is seeking a Director, Global Process Owner (GPO) – Quote-to-Cash to serve as the single-threaded owner of the company’s end-to-end Quote-to-Cash process architecture across Cloud, Enterprise Advanced (EA), and Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for designing and governing scalable, durable Quote-to-Cash processes that support MongoDB’s evolving business models, product offerings, and global growth. The Director, GPO – Quote-to-Cash establishes global process standards, resolves design tradeoffs across functional pillars, and ensures Finance processes scale efficiently as transaction complexity and volume increase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leader acts as Finance’s primary process design partner to IT, Product, Engineering, Deal Strategy, and Go-to-Market teams, ensuring that new products, monetization models, and operational workflows are implemented in a controlled and scalable manner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Importantly, this role does not run the close or manage transactional accounting or operational processing teams. Instead, the role focuses on long-term process architecture, operating model design, and structural simplification across the Quote-to-Cash ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines deep understanding of Quote-to-Cash processes with strong systems thinking, operational design capability, and cross-functional influence in a high-growth public-company environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking to speak with candidates based in New York City or Austin for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;End-to-End Quote-to-Cash Process Ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the single global owner of MongoDB’s Quote-to-Cash process architecture across:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud / consumption-based offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Advanced (EA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain globally consistent process standards, governance models, and design principles across the Quote-to-Cash lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure process decisions are scalable across evolving products, pricing models, geographies, and routes to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process Architecture &amp;amp; Operating Model Design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable end-to-end workflows spanning:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal structure and approvals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Billing and invoicing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue-impacting operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer lifecycle transitions and renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify structural inefficiencies, fragmented ownership models, and manual dependencies across the Quote-to-Cash ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive simplification and standardization efforts that reduce operational complexity and improve scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Governance &amp;amp; Tradeoff Resolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Finance’s primary design partner to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT and Finance Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Strategy and Go-to-Market Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue Accounting and Order-to-Cash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve cross-functional tradeoffs between process scalability, customer experience, operational efficiency, and control requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish governance mechanisms for prioritizing and evaluating Quote-to-Cash process changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Products &amp;amp; Monetization Models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the operational process design for new products, pricing constructs, and monetization models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure new revenue motions are operationally supportable before launch and can scale without disproportionate manual intervention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technical Revenue Accounting and operational teams to ensure process flows support accounting, billing, and reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a multi-year Quote-to-Cash transformation roadmap aligned with company growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives focused on:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reducing manual intervention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarifying ownership boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing operational scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish process metrics and governance frameworks to measure process health and organizational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Success Metrics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role is measured by&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustained reduction in manual intervention and workflow exceptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fewer cross-functional escalations tied to process ambiguity or design gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved scalability of Quote-to-Cash operations as the business grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stable Finance operational headcount relative to revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful operationalization of new business models without downstream disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Quote-to-Cash, Revenue Operations, Revenue Accounting Operations, Finance Transformation, or related functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of end-to-end Quote-to-Cash workflows in a SaaS or consumption-based business model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and scaling global operational processes in a high-growth public-company environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership skills with experience influencing Product, Engineering, IT, Finance, and GTM organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to resolve complex operational tradeoffs and drive organizational alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting cloud or usage-based monetization models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading enterprise-scale process transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with revenue accounting and billing operational requirements under ASC 606&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in complex multi-system environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership Attributes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems Thinker: Designs processes that scale across products, geographies, and operating models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, Not Operator: Focuses on structural design and long-term scalability rather than day-to-day transaction execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Influencer: Aligns diverse stakeholders without relying on formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplifier: Reduces complexity, ambiguity, and manual effort across workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outcome-Oriented: Measures success through scalable operational outcomes, not activity volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As MongoDB continues to evolve its products, pricing models, and global operations, scalable Quote-to-Cash process architecture becomes increasingly critical. This role ensures that Finance can support business growth without linear operational complexity, enabling durable scale across systems, teams, and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
