&lt;p&gt;Mongo is seeking a &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Head of AI Platform, GM&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead the development and scaling of a new AI Applications Platform. With millions of developers trusting MongoDB for their workloads, MongoDB is building the future to enable them to create, deploy and manage AI Applications at enterprise scale. As GM you will own the business, vision and execution of this Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique &quot;intrapreneurial&quot; role where you will act as the CEO of the product line. You will own the end-to-end success of the platform, with direct responsibility over the R&amp;amp;D organization (Engineering, Product, and Design).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the VP &amp;amp; GM, you will lead the transition from 0 to 1—defining the technical architecture, building a world-class team of engineers and product thinkers, and scaling the platform to support thousands of customers building production-grade AI applications. You are someone who can debate the nuances of multi-agent orchestration and Model Context Protocol (MCP) in the morning, and present a three-year commercial growth strategy to the board in the afternoon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role can be based in our San Francisco and New York City offices or remotely in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Execution (0 to Scale): &lt;/span&gt;Own the roadmap and delivery of the AI Platform. Take the product from its current state to a market-leading, developer-first platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Business Ownership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L for the business unit. Manage the budget for R&amp;amp;D, infrastructure/inference costs, and headcount planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;D Leadership:&lt;/span&gt; Build and lead a distributed high-performance R&amp;amp;D organization. You will manage Engineering, Forward Deployed Engineering, Product Management, and Product Design, fostering a culture of rapid iteration and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AI Strategy:&lt;/span&gt; Build the technical vision for the area, and lead technologists and product managers to document and evangelize the strategy with internal and external customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Go-to-Market Partnership:&lt;/span&gt; Collaborate with Partnerships, Sales and Marketing to define our GTM motion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Customer Evangelism:&lt;/span&gt; Act as the &quot;technical face&quot; of the product for strategic customers, partners, and the open-source community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurial Track Record:&lt;/span&gt; Experience as a founder, early-stage employee, or &quot;0-to-1&quot; leader within a larger tech company. You must have experience building and launching a software product from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Technical Depth in AI:&lt;/span&gt; Deep understanding of the AI landscape. You should be familiar with AI frameworks, foundation models, embeddings and vector databases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Platform Expertise:&lt;/span&gt; 10+ years of experience building scalable Cloud/SaaS products, enterprise infrastructure software or developer platforms (APIs, SDKs, or infrastructure tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Leader of Leaders:&lt;/span&gt; Proven experience managing managers and leading cross-functional organizations of 100+ people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product-Led Mindset:&lt;/span&gt; A &quot;product-hacker&quot; mentality. You prioritize shipping and learning over perfection, but understand the reliability requirements of enterprise-grade software.&lt;/li&gt;
