&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead, develop, and motivate high-performing teams in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational mindset with experience improving processes, managing competing priorities, and driving scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
