&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales organization, to impact both tactical and strategic opportunity success of our field sales force&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Business Value Consulting collateral for internal and external use: when new MongoDB products are released, and when a gap or need of the practice is identified&lt;/li&gt;
