&lt;li&gt;Create and present the business case and the forecasted business impact the customer can achieve using MongoDB solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical concepts and recommendations into business benefits for management and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel is required but varies throughout the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A. / B.S. from an accredited college; preference for Business Management, Economics, Finance or related degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of proven experience as a Business/Technology Strategy Consultant with some Business Case experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3+ years of experience working for a vendor in business value consulting role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise business and financial modeling experience, familiarity with key financial metrics: ROI, TCO, NPV, IRR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polished presentation and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inquisitive personality to facilitate interview sessions with client roles, both business and technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience addressing executive and senior level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical understanding of enterprise infrastructure, technology stack, software development methodologies (SDLC, Agile, DevOps), RDBMS and/or NoSQL software&lt;/li&gt;
