&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a hardworking, driven individual with superb energy, passion and initiative for new business acquisition. The Senior Commercial Growth Account Executive, Acquisition role focuses exclusively on formulating and executing a sales strategy within an assigned territory, resulting in new customer acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
