&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a seasoned Senior Manager – Finance Technology to lead our India-based FinTech engineering organization supporting global Finance systems. This leader will own strategy, architecture, delivery, and operational excellence across core finance platforms including NetSuite, Coupa, SAP Concur, and RPA/AI-driven automation solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;functional expertise in Finance (O2C, P2P, R2R, FP&amp;amp;A, Treasury, Tax) combined with deep systems knowledge. The ideal candidate can bridge Finance, Engineering, and Business stakeholders while building a high-performing team in India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Gurugram or Bengaluru for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
