&lt;p&gt;The Employee Experience Team at MongoDB is the face of HR to our global employee population. The team is responsible for delivering full employee lifecycle support—from onboarding through separation—in partnership with the broader People Team, including Recruiting, Total Rewards, Learning &amp;amp; Development, Employee Engagement &amp;amp; Inclusion, HR Business Partnering, and HR Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
