&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-powered and agentic tools such as Cursor, Claude Code, Agentforce, and similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps and CI/CD tools such as Copado, Gearset, Git-based deployment workflows, or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
