&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA, M.Sc., or Ph.D. in relevant technical or business domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MongoDB or other non-relational database technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading products targeting developer personas in fast-paced, growing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with open-source and cloud-native technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
