&lt;li&gt;Lead enterprise-wide transformation initiatives (e.g., AI &amp;amp; modern architectures, new sales motions, partner models), ensuring alignment and adoption across functions and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive global consistency in methodologies, tools, and best practices (e.g., MEDDIC, value-based discovery, solution design, POCs, and technical win strategies) to optimize resource effectiveness and deal velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a visible executive sponsor with key customers and partners, representing MongoDB’s technical strategy and long-term vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the budget and investment strategy for the global Solutions Consulting org; make data-driven tradeoffs that optimize impact, scalability, and long-term value creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model MongoDB’s Leadership Commitment and high-performance culture by driving clear, candid communication through change and transformation, centering decisions on enterprise priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20+ years of relevant experience, with 10+ years in technical pre-sales, solutions consulting, sales engineering, or similar customer-facing technical roles, including enterprise software/cloud/data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years successfully leading division-level or equivalent pre-sales organizations, navigating high velocity change, organizational complexity, and cross-functional collaboration while delivering measurable revenue impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to set and execute strategic enterprise-wide change (e.g., GTM redesign, new product introductions, AI/modernization programs, major sales motion shifts) and design scalable operating models to drive sustained growth and measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to anticipate market changes, customer needs, and drive innovation through investments in cloud/data/AI-driven GTM environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise and thought leadership in modern GTM and sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDIC / MEDDPICC), and a track record of institutionalizing these frameworks at scale—setting standards, inspecting rigor, and holding senior GTM leaders accountable to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of owning a full P&amp;amp;L or functional budget: making strategic investment decisions, managing tradeoffs, and improving productivity and ROI over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building high-performing, inclusive leadership teams by addressing performance issues quickly and fairly, and creating cultures grounded in development, transparency, and continuous feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound technical and commercial judgment working with complex solutions (e.g., cloud platforms, data/AI, infrastructure, developer tools), with depth to drive strategy and investments and build credibility in both technical and business forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
