&lt;li&gt;Known for your ability to distill complex technical and commercial issues into clear, compelling narratives for any audience while preserving nuance and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong business acumen and executive gravitas, earning credibility with customer CIOs and senior technology leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key executive sponsor to our most strategic customers and partners by participating in Customer Advisory Board (CAB) meetings and executive programs, representing MongoDB to C-level customer stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a customer-obsessed executive: you earn trust with customers and partners, and you work backwards from their outcomes to shape our strategy and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
