&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, product management, and design teams to refine requirements and deliver incremental customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate actively in technical design discussions, code reviews, debugging, and operational support for the systems your team owns&lt;/li&gt;
