&lt;li&gt;Improve developer and customer experience across APIs, UI workflows, infrastructure configuration, and operational tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify technical debt, usability gaps, and opportunities to improve system reliability, supportability, and engineering processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate project status, risks, and technical tradeoffs clearly with teammates and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support teammates through thoughtful code reviews, technical collaboration, onboarding assistance, and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
