&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement new features within MongoDB&#39;s $search and $vectorSearch aggregation operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Product teams to define new query and index syntax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address performance bottlenecks in filter queries and nearest neighbor search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the opportunity to lead projects and own subsystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform code reviews with peers, review technical designs, and mentor junior developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
