&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools and methodologies for code analysis, refactoring, and automated testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in designing and implementing complex software systems, collaborating effectively with engineers of all experience levels to achieve high reliability and performance&lt;/li&gt;
