&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 1 month you’ll have shipped code into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 3 months, you&#39;ll be fully onboarded and have contributed to a large project that involves multiple MongoDB engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
